  "details": "# How to reproduce\n\nOpen the test world in desktop mode.\n\n- https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_1baec824-dd56-4944-91bd-7b3b690a546c\n\n- This world has a floor and a textured plane.\n\nOpen the camera before making any player move\n\n- The camera and the plane are in a parallel.\n\nEnable semi-auto focus and minimize aperture value\n\n# Expected behavior\n\nCaptured image will not be blurred.\n\nDistances to each pixel are equal to the distance to the focus point, so they must be in focus.\n\n# Actual behavior\n\nCaptured image is blurred.",
